, the game follows Geralt of Rivia, a monster hunter searching for his adopted daughter, Ciri, while navigating political conflicts and supernatural threats. Gameplay features exploration, combat, character progression, and branching narratives shaped by player choices. Widely acclaimed for its writing, world-building, and depth, it is considered one of the most influential RPGs of its generation.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-witcher-3-wild-hunt", "videos": [{"id": 9648, "name": "Developer Diary: Creating the Sound", "video_id": "yowv6_rspoM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yowv6_rspoM", "title": "The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt - Developer Diary: Creating the Sound (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/yowv6_rspoM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 5993, "name": "TV Spot", "video_id": "xQGam9OHSUo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xQGam9OHSUo", "title": "The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt - TV Spot (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xQGam9OHSUo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 5990, "name": "Opening Cinematic: The Trail", "video_id": "QrwGXAcE6ZA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QrwGXAcE6ZA", "title": "The Witcher 3 - Opening Cinematic: The Trail", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QrwGXAcE6ZA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 5992, "name": "Recap", "video_id": "bcEAsOC_8L0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bcEAsOC_8L0", "title": "The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt - Recap (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bcEAsOC_8L0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 5987, "name": "The Begining trailer", "video_id": "5nLipy-Z4yo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5nLipy-Z4yo", "title": "The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt - The Beginning trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5nLipy-Z4yo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 5995, "name": "A Night to Remember Trailer", "video_id": "8ZLfJjlZKvc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8ZLfJjlZKvc", "title": "The